[
  {
    "content_id": "10061001001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得後書 1:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "61001001",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;我是耶穌基督的奴僕和使徒西門·彼得，寫信給藉著我們的上帝和救主耶穌基督的義，與我們得到同樣寶貴信心的人。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10061001002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得後書 1:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "61001002",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;願你們因認識上帝和我們的主耶穌而飽得恩典和平安！</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10061001003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得後書 1:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "61001003",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;因為我們認識了用自己的榮耀和美德呼召我們的上帝，上帝以祂神聖的能力將生命與敬虔所需要的一切賜給了我們。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10061001004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得後書 1:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "61001004",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;藉此，祂已將既寶貴又偉大的應許賞給了我們，使我們脫離世上私慾帶來的敗壞，能夠有份於上帝的性情。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10061001005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得後書 1:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "61001005",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;正因如此，你們要加倍努力，不僅要有信心，還要有美德；不僅要有美德，還要有知識；</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10061001006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得後書 1:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "61001006",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;不僅要有知識，還要有自制；不僅要有自制，還要有忍耐；不僅要有忍耐，還要有敬虔；</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10061001007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得後書 1:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "61001007",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;不僅要有敬虔，還要有愛弟兄姊妹的心；不僅要有愛弟兄姊妹的心，還要有愛眾人的心。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10061001008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得後書 1:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "61001008",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;你們如果具備這些品質，並且不斷加強，就不會對我們主耶穌基督的認識停滯不前，毫無果效。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10061001009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得後書 1:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "61001009",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;缺乏上述品質的人則是目光短淺，甚至瞎眼，忘記他從前的罪已經得到潔淨。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10061001010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得後書 1:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "61001010",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;所以，弟兄姊妹，你們要更加努力，以確定自己蒙了呼召和揀選。你們這樣做，就絕不會失足犯罪，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10061001011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得後書 1:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "61001011",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;進入我們的主和救主耶穌基督永恆國度的大門必為你們敞開。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10061001012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得後書 1:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "61001012",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;雖然你們已經知道這些事，並且在已有的真道上也很篤定，但我還是要常常提醒你們。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10061001013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得後書 1:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "61001013",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;我覺得應當趁著我還在世的時候提醒你們，激勵你們，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10061001014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得後書 1:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "61001014",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;因我知道自己離世的日子已經不遠了，正如我們的主耶穌基督指示我的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10061001015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得後書 1:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "61001015",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;我要盡力使你們在我離世以後仍然常常記得這些事。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10061001016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得後書 1:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "61001016",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;我們從前告訴你們有關主耶穌基督的大能和祂降臨的事，並非根據巧妙虛構的傳說，而是我們親眼見過祂的威榮。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10061001017",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得後書 1:17",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "61001017",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>17</sup>&nbsp;祂從父上帝那裡得到了尊貴和榮耀，那時從至大榮光中有聲音對祂說：「這是我的愛子，我喜悅祂。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10061001018",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得後書 1:18",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "61001018",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>18</sup>&nbsp;當時我們和祂一同在聖山上，親耳聽見了這來自天上的聲音。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10061001019",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得後書 1:19",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "61001019",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>19</sup>&nbsp;這使我們更加確信先知的預言。你們要好好留意這些預言，把這些預言看作照耀在黑暗中的明燈，一直到天破曉、晨星在你們心中升起。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10061001020",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得後書 1:20",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "61001020",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>20</sup>&nbsp;你們首先該知道：聖經上的一切預言都不可隨人的私意解釋，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10061001021",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得後書 1:21",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "61001021",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>21</sup>&nbsp;因為預言絕非出於人的意思，都是人受了聖靈的感動，講出上帝的信息。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10061002001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得後書 2:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "61002001",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;以往曾經有假先知在百姓中出現，將來在你們中間也同樣會有假教師出現。他們暗地裡引進使人滅亡的異端邪說，甚至否認那位買贖他們的主。這些人正迅速地自招滅亡。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10061002002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得後書 2:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "61002002",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;許多人會效法他們邪惡無恥的行為，致使真理之道被人毀謗。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10061002003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得後書 2:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "61002003",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;他們貪婪成性，會用花言巧語在你們身上牟利。這種人的刑罰自古已經判定，他們很快就會滅亡。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10061002004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得後書 2:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "61002004",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;即使天使犯了罪，上帝也沒有容忍他們，而是把他們扔進地獄裡，囚在幽暗的深坑等候審判。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10061002005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得後書 2:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "61002005",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;上帝也沒有容忍遠古的世代，曾用洪水淹滅了世上不敬虔的惡人，只留下傳講公義的挪亞和他的七位家人。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10061002006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得後書 2:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "61002006",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;上帝也審判了所多瑪和蛾摩拉，將二城毀滅，燒為灰燼，作為以後不敬虔之人的警戒。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10061002007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得後書 2:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "61002007",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;祂只拯救了因惡人的淫亂放蕩而憂傷的義人羅得，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10061002008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得後書 2:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "61002008",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;因為義人羅得住在他們當中，天天耳聞目睹他們的不法行為，他正直的心很痛苦。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10061002009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得後書 2:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "61002009",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;可見上帝知道怎樣拯救敬虔的人脫離試煉，把不義的人拘禁在刑罰之下，等候審判的日子，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10061002010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得後書 2:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "61002010",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;尤其是那些放縱污穢的情慾、輕視權柄的人。他們膽大妄為，肆無忌憚地毀謗有尊榮的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10061002011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得後書 2:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "61002011",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;即使力量和權能更大的天使都不在主面前用毀謗的話控告有尊榮的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10061002012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得後書 2:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "61002012",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;但他們好像沒有理性，生下來就是預備讓人捉去宰殺的牲畜，對自己不懂的事也隨口毀謗，最終必像牲畜一樣被毀滅。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10061002013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得後書 2:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "61002013",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;他們多行不義，必自食惡果。他們喜愛在大白天尋歡作樂，是敗類和渣滓，一面和你們同席，一面以欺騙為樂。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10061002014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得後書 2:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "61002014",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;他們眼中充滿淫慾，不停地犯罪，引誘那些信心不堅定的人。他們貪婪成性，實在是該受咒詛！</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10061002015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得後書 2:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "61002015",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;他們離棄正道，走入歧途，重蹈比珥之子巴蘭的覆轍。巴蘭貪愛不義之財，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10061002016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得後書 2:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "61002016",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;因自己的罪而受了責備。不能說話的驢竟然像人一樣說起話來，制止了他狂妄的行為。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10061002017",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得後書 2:17",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "61002017",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>17</sup>&nbsp;他們如同枯乾的水井和被狂風吹散的霧氣，有幽幽黑暗留給他們。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10061002018",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得後書 2:18",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "61002018",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>18</sup>&nbsp;他們口出狂言，空話連篇，以肉體的邪情私慾為餌，誘惑那些剛剛擺脫了荒謬生活的人。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10061002019",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得後書 2:19",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "61002019",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>19</sup>&nbsp;他們許諾給人自由，而自己卻被敗壞奴役，因為人被什麼制伏，就被什麼奴役。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10061002020",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得後書 2:20",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "61002020",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>20</sup>&nbsp;他們如果藉著認識我們的主和救主耶穌基督，已經擺脫了世俗的污穢，但後來又被這些事纏住、俘虜了，結局會比以前更糟糕。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10061002021",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得後書 2:21",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "61002021",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>21</sup>&nbsp;他們明知道正路，卻背棄了傳給他們的神聖誡命，這樣倒不如不知道的好。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10061002022",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得後書 2:22",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "61002022",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>22</sup>&nbsp;俗語說得好：「狗轉身吃自己所吐的；豬洗乾淨了，又回到污泥裡去打滾。」這些話正好用在他們身上。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10061003001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得後書 3:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "61003001",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;親愛的弟兄姊妹，我現在寫給你們的是第二封信。這兩封信都是為了提醒你們，激勵你們保持真誠的心，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10061003002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得後書 3:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "61003002",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;叫你們記得從前聖先知們說的預言，以及我們的主和救主藉使徒傳給你們的誡命。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10061003003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得後書 3:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "61003003",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;最重要的是，你們要知道，末世必出現冷嘲熱諷、放縱自己邪情私慾的人。他們說：</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10061003004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得後書 3:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "61003004",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;「主要降臨的應許在哪裡？從我們的祖先長眠地下直到現在，萬物依舊與創世之初一樣。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10061003005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得後書 3:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "61003005",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;他們故意忽略：太初，上帝憑口中的話語創造了諸天，並藉著水從水中造出了地；</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10061003006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得後書 3:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "61003006",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;後來，那個世界被水淹沒而毀滅了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10061003007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得後書 3:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "61003007",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;現在的天地同樣是憑上帝的話語保留到被火焚燒的日子，就是不敬虔的人被審判和毀滅的日子。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10061003008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得後書 3:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "61003008",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;親愛的弟兄姊妹，有一件事你們不可忽略，就是主看一日如千年，千年如一日。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10061003009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得後書 3:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "61003009",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;主的應許還未實現，有人以為祂拖延，其實祂不是拖延，而是在寬容你們。祂不願任何人滅亡，願意人人都悔改。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10061003010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得後書 3:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "61003010",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;不過，主的日子會像賊一樣突然臨到。那日，諸天必在一聲巨響中消失，有形有質的都要被烈火熔化，大地和其中的一切將不復存在。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10061003011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得後書 3:11-12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "61003011",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11-12</sup>&nbsp;既然一切都要這樣被熔化，你們在熱切等候上帝的日子來臨期間，該過怎樣聖潔、敬虔的生活啊！因為到那日，天要被火焚毀，有形有質的都要被烈火熔化。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10061003013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得後書 3:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "61003013",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;但我們等候的是上帝應許的新天新地，有公義住在其中。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10061003014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得後書 3:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "61003014",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;所以，親愛的弟兄姊妹，你們既然盼望這些事，就當努力使自己在主面前毫無瑕疵，無可指責，安然無懼。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10061003015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得後書 3:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "61003015",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;你們要把我們主的寬容看作是讓眾人得救的機會，正如我們親愛的弟兄保羅按著上帝賜給他的智慧寫信告訴你們的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10061003016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得後書 3:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "61003016",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;他所有的書信都談到這些事。一些不學無術、反覆無常的人曲解了信中一些難懂的地方，就像曲解其他經文一樣，他們是自取滅亡。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10061003017",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得後書 3:17",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "61003017",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>17</sup>&nbsp;因此，親愛的弟兄姊妹，你們既然預先知道了這些事，就應該小心謹慎，不要讓那些不法之徒用錯謬的理論引誘你們，使你們失去原本堅定的立場。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10061003018",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得後書 3:18",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "61003018",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>18</sup>&nbsp;相反，你們要在我們的主和救主耶穌基督的恩典中不斷長進，越來越認識祂。 願榮耀歸給祂，從現在直到永遠。阿們！</p>"
  }
]